---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Shipping Information - YumCraft">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-16 px-4 md:px-0 bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-orange max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif font-bold mb-8 text-brand-text">Shipping Information (USA)</h1>
      
      <p class="lead">
        Thank you for trusting YumCraft for your kitchen gear recommendations! Because we are a review and curation site, we do not directly manufacture, warehouse, or ship the products you see on our website.
      </p>

      <h2>How Fulfillment Works</h2>
      <p>
        All physical products listed in our "Kitchen Finds" sections are fulfilled by third-party sellers on the AliExpress platform. When you click the "Shop Now" button on a product page, you are redirected to AliExpress where you will complete your purchase securely.
      </p>

      <h2>Shipping Times & Costs</h2>
      <p>
        Because products are sourced from various international and domestic warehouses on AliExpress, shipping times and costs will vary depending on:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>The specific seller you are buying from.</li>
        <li>The shipping method you select at checkout (e.g., Standard vs. Premium).</li>
        <li>Your exact location within the USA.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Many sellers on AliExpress offer <strong>Free Shipping</strong> or "Choice" delivery which guarantees faster delivery (often 10-15 days) to the USA. Always verify the estimated delivery date on the AliExpress product page before completing your checkout.
      </p>

      <h2>Order Tracking & Returns</h2>
      <p>
        Once you place an order, AliExpress will provide you with a tracking number via your AliExpress account. If you have any issues with your delivery, a defective item, or need to process a return, you must use the <strong>AliExpress Buyer Protection</strong> system to open a dispute or contact the seller directly. 
      </p>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl my-8 border-l-4 border-gray-300">
        <p class="m-0 text-gray-600 text-sm">
          <em>Note: YumCraft does not have access to your order details, tracking information, or payment data. All customer service inquiries regarding shipping and returns must be handled through AliExpress.</em>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
